WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:05.830
Keep your eyes on me! You're my sweet good boy!

00:05.830 --> 00:09.000
When I'm with you life is w-w-wonderful!

00:09.000 --> 00:12.080
1, 2, 3, now jump! Affectionate attention

00:12.080 --> 00:15.170
3, 2, 1, now turn! So many hot sparks

00:15.170 --> 00:18.330
1-to-1, now love! Unfortunate fraction

00:18.330 --> 00:21.460
From wonderful morning till night,
I'll give you everything

00:21.460 --> 00:24.540
Tell me how much you love me, my little boy

00:24.540 --> 00:28.130
Love me! Love me! Let me love you, I want you

00:28.670 --> 00:34.460
Live your life!
Sprint forward with all you've got!

00:34.460 --> 00:41.130
At the finish line is a new you
(Go beyond yourself!)

00:41.130 --> 00:46.920
Howl loud and proud!
Yesterday might have beaten you down

00:46.920 --> 00:49.960
But tomorrow (Affectionate Attention)
you and I (Unfortunate Fraction)

00:49.960 --> 00:54.170
Will shine as bright as we can!

00:54.170 --> 00:55.670
This is your life, your way!

00:55.790 --> 00:57.330
This is my life, my way!

00:57.460 --> 00:58.330
Woof!

01:03.580 --> 01:09.000
<b>Doggy Foot Bath.</b>

01:04.790 --> 01:07.710
<b>Sakihira Festival</b>

01:20.250 --> 01:22.170
That outfit is amazing on her...

01:22.790 --> 01:24.040
She's gorgeous!

01:25.880 --> 01:29.540
C'mon, Pochita, stop staring...

01:29.540 --> 01:32.290
Crap, gotta watch how much I stare...

01:34.920 --> 01:36.630
Welcome home, Master!

01:37.790 --> 01:38.750
Customers!

01:38.750 --> 01:40.790
Follow me and I'll get you seated!

01:47.330 --> 01:51.380
I wasn't sure what I'd have to do
at a dog café,

01:51.790 --> 01:54.670
but I guess it's just
letting customers pet me...

01:57.880 --> 02:01.420
Inukai-san's jealous glare
still gives me the heebie-jeebies...

02:02.080 --> 02:05.130
But if we attract enough customers,

02:05.920 --> 02:09.790
that suspicious chick
is gonna have to show up!

02:13.330 --> 02:18.210
Weird. It's lunchtime, shouldn't we
have more customers?

02:22.250 --> 02:23.670
Guys, bad news!

02:23.670 --> 02:26.420
The bunny café is stealing our customers!

02:26.420 --> 02:27.380
What?!

02:27.380 --> 02:28.420
Really?!

02:29.080 --> 02:30.920
That's so uncool!

02:39.670 --> 02:41.750
A bunny café?!

02:41.750 --> 02:43.420
That must be Tsukishiro's class!

02:54.250 --> 02:55.790
What now?

02:57.500 --> 03:00.880
All our hard work's gonna be for nothing...

03:06.920 --> 03:08.080
Hey...

03:08.290 --> 03:09.420
Inukai-san?!

03:09.710 --> 03:11.710
I have an idea...

03:13.880 --> 03:17.380
Inukai-san is talking to people on her own?!

03:17.380 --> 03:21.750
Pochita's tongue is, uh, really rough...

03:21.750 --> 03:24.790
It feels really good when he licks your feet.

03:24.790 --> 03:27.040
So maybe...

03:27.040 --> 03:29.880
Have you lost your mind, Inukai-san?

03:31.880 --> 03:36.000
What if we say we're giving out
doggy foot baths?

03:36.000 --> 03:37.420
Doggy foot baths?

03:37.420 --> 03:40.000
Y'know, that's a pretty nice idea, Inukai-san!

03:40.000 --> 03:42.460
Wait, what the actual hell is
a doggy foot bath?!

03:48.630 --> 03:52.580
Wow, where'd all your customers go?

03:54.500 --> 03:58.210
Guess our bunny café is
just that much cooler!

03:58.500 --> 04:04.250
Well, as long as I'm here, I might as well
collect on my prize for our bet.

04:05.500 --> 04:07.670
Where's my darling Senpai?

04:08.000 --> 04:10.710
I'll show you to your seat.

04:10.710 --> 04:12.290
Wait, what?

04:13.580 --> 04:16.710
Here you are, mistress.

04:16.710 --> 04:18.250
Huh? Wait...

04:20.330 --> 04:21.580
Hello?!

04:21.830 --> 04:24.330
Please remove your shoes.

04:24.330 --> 04:26.580
Huh? Why?

04:29.130 --> 04:31.540
Fine, but where's Senpai?

04:32.460 --> 04:33.710
I get it...

04:33.710 --> 04:36.750
Instead of a traditional foot bath,
we're using dogs instead!

04:36.750 --> 04:39.750
And we'll bathe their feet
with our tongues?!

04:42.580 --> 04:44.330
Wha- Senpai?!

04:44.330 --> 04:47.960
Mistress, please stay seated.

04:53.290 --> 04:55.290
Senpai's tongue...

04:56.830 --> 04:58.790
Feels so good!

05:04.460 --> 05:06.960
Senpai's licking me...

05:09.830 --> 05:15.830
Senpai, give it to me, all the way...

05:18.960 --> 05:21.210
It feels so good... Harder!

05:28.080 --> 05:29.380
Senpai!

05:29.960 --> 05:31.330
Please!

05:43.330 --> 05:45.380
Sorry, Tsukishiro.

05:58.710 --> 06:01.380
We're getting tons more customers
for our doggy foot bath!

06:02.130 --> 06:08.460
It's getting late, though, and that girl
in the labcoat hasn't shown up yet.

06:09.420 --> 06:12.750
Maybe she's not even interested
in checking this place out.

06:13.380 --> 06:16.920
But I can't go looking for her,

06:16.920 --> 06:19.540
'cause Inukai-san would just
grab me before I left...

06:20.130 --> 06:21.420
What now?

06:24.960 --> 06:26.920
Welcome home, Master!

06:27.290 --> 06:30.710
Hey, there. You guys still open?

06:30.710 --> 06:34.040
I heard you're giving
doggy foot baths or something.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.750
Speak of the devil!

06:36.670 --> 06:39.540
Okay if I take a seat here?

06:41.670 --> 06:45.500
What would you like to order, Mistress?

06:45.500 --> 06:47.750
And that's Inukai-san!

06:48.960 --> 06:51.000
I'll take a coffee.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.630
Heavy on the sugar.

06:55.250 --> 06:58.040
All right, boy, get to licking.

06:59.920 --> 07:04.540
I wouldn't balk at licking Inukai-san's feet,
or Nekotani or Tsukishiro's...

07:05.500 --> 07:08.580
C'mon, use that tongue already.

07:08.580 --> 07:10.750
That's your job here, isn't it?

07:10.750 --> 07:13.170
But I kinda don't wanna lick hers...

07:16.540 --> 07:21.710
Here's your order, Mistress,
coffee, heavy on the sugar.

07:21.710 --> 07:23.830
Thanks, sweetheart.

07:24.380 --> 07:27.540
So, can I ask you a hypothetical question?

07:28.540 --> 07:33.630
If your dog here was actually a human
in a dog's body, how would you feel?

07:33.630 --> 07:35.580
I knew it! It was her!

07:35.580 --> 07:37.710
That's just not possible.

07:38.540 --> 07:41.540
Hey, anything's possible.

07:42.040 --> 07:46.540
I mean, your taste in "men"
is proof enough of that.

07:53.420 --> 07:55.250
C'mon, sweetheart.

07:56.540 --> 08:00.380
If your precious dog was
just a human in disguise...

08:00.380 --> 08:02.710
Would you still love him?

08:04.630 --> 08:07.420
Or would you hate him?

08:18.460 --> 08:20.830
She's torturing Inukai-san!

08:21.040 --> 08:22.380
How dare she!

08:22.670 --> 08:24.000
I'll show her!

08:30.250 --> 08:33.250
Have a little taste of my
tantalizing tongue technique!

08:57.330 --> 09:01.080
Dammit! She's not reacting in the slightest!

09:01.080 --> 09:03.790
Sure, I got her to shut up,
but she won't look down!

09:24.000 --> 09:27.540
Okay, I get where you're coming from now.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.710
We'll talk again soon.

09:31.710 --> 09:33.420
All three of us.

09:37.500 --> 09:41.630
Whoa, you okay, Inukai-san?

09:41.630 --> 09:43.540
Do you need a break?

09:45.290 --> 09:46.500
Inukai-san...

09:47.960 --> 09:50.380
That bitch... She'll pay for that!

09:55.710 --> 09:57.460
There she is! Okay!

09:58.380 --> 10:00.580
Why'd she interrogate Inukai-san?!

10:00.830 --> 10:03.790
What's she really after?!

10:08.130 --> 10:09.960
Where the hell is she going?

10:10.330 --> 10:13.130
This is the way to the old school building!

10:16.380 --> 10:19.170
Is this... her lair?

10:16.380 --> 10:19.670
<b>No Trespassing</b>

10:23.130 --> 10:24.420
<b>No Trespassing</b>

10:34.750 --> 10:36.080
A light?

10:37.960 --> 10:39.960
She must be somewhere in there...

10:50.630 --> 10:52.580
Up here, boy.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.210
Hiya.

10:55.210 --> 11:00.420
You lookin' for me, Inari Sakihira?

11:03.080 --> 11:06.830
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:07.880 --> 11:10.460
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:10.460 --> 11:12.710
Let's Go! Come Home, Boy!

11:12.880 --> 11:17.290
You're so cute, I can't help but love you!

11:17.290 --> 11:22.460
I'll take you home and make you happy,
so c'mere, boy!

11:22.460 --> 11:26.580
The secret moments when I pet and kiss you

11:26.960 --> 11:31.630
Are precious moments to be honest about my love

11:32.000 --> 11:34.170
This feeling I'm yearning for

11:34.540 --> 11:36.540
This feeling I've been hiding

11:37.080 --> 11:38.920
This feeling I've finally found

11:38.920 --> 11:40.580
Hear it now! Feel it now!

11:40.580 --> 11:42.580
I l-l-l-l-love you!

11:42.580 --> 11:46.290
I hope my feelings will reach you one day

11:46.460 --> 11:50.670
One day, when you look up and see me

11:50.670 --> 11:53.210
I wanna be number one in your puppy heart!

11:53.210 --> 11:56.080
From the bottom of my heart, I love you!
